    <section class="pageHero">
      <div class="kicker">INSIGHTS</div>
      <h1>Substack writing — strategy, governance & execution</h1>
      <p>
        I publish practical, no-fluff thinking on how regulated financial institutions actually run — operating models,
        operational risk & resilience, payments modernisation, and transformation delivery that holds up under scrutiny.
      </p>

      <div class="badgeRow">
        <span class="badge"><span class="dot"></span>Operating model</span>
